<title>UK: Hokuriku Electric sets 85 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>Hokuriku Electric sets 85 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Dai-Ichi Bank (Switzerland) AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOKURIKU ELECTRIC INDUSTRY CO LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE DAI-ICHI KANGYO BANK AND THE HOKURIKU BANK</p>
<p> AMT    85 MLN SFR    COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    21.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    21.MAR.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 50	  LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
